conducted according to the reported procedure. Under nitrogen atmosphere,
(S)-BINOL was weighed into a tared flask and dissolved in Et2O (3 mL). An
alkyne, Cy2NH, and Et2Zn were added, and the mixture was stirred for 16 h
(or 48 h). Then, Ti(OiPr)4 was added, followed by an aldehyde (0.25
