5.12 (1H, br s, CH), 6.87 (1H, t, J = 2.1 Hz, CH); 13C NMR (75 MHz,
CDCl3, TMS): δ 13.6, 22.1, 26.2, 30.8, 31.3, 38.5, 75.1, 145.4, 145.6,
200.4; MS (EI) m/z (%): 168 (0.6) [M+ ], 150 (13.0), 126 (15.7), 111
(100), 83 (48.7), 55 (30.2); HRMS (EI) calcd. for C10H16O2 (M+ ) requires
