$DATUM General/Typical Procedure:
(1R,2R,5S)-5-tert-Butyldimethylsilyloxy-2-methyl-1-hydroxy-1-phenyl-3-hexanone
(syn,anti-11a). Trichlorosilyl enol ether (Z)-7 (364 mg, 1.00 mmol) was
added to a solution of (R,R)-20a (37 mg, 0.10 mmol, 0.10 equiv) in 1.00
mL of CH2Cl2. The reaction mixture was cooled to -78 °C and PhCHO (102
μL, 1.00 mmol, 1 equiv) was added by syringe. After stirring for 6 h, the
reaction mixture was quenched by pouring it into a vigorously stirring
solution of cold, sat. aq. NaHCO3 solution (15 mL). The resulting slurry
was stirred for 3 h and was filtered through Celite. The layers were
separated, and the aqueous layer was extracted with 20 mL of CH2Cl2. The
organic phases were combined, washed with 5 mL of brine and were dried
(Na2SO4), filtered, and concentrated. The crude product was purified by
column chromatography (pentane/ether, 3/1, SiO2).
(2S,5S,6S)-2-Triisopropylsilyloxy-5-methyl-6-hydroxy-8-phenyl-7-octen-4-one
(syn,syn-12c). Yield: 304 mg (0.75 mmol, 75%) of 12c as a clear,
colorless, viscous oil. Data for (syn,syn)-12c: 1H NMR: (500 MHz, CDCl3)
7.37 (d, J=7.1, 2 H, HC(13)); 7.31 (t, J=7.8, 2 H, HC(14)); 7.24 (t,
J=7.4, 1 H, HC(15)); 6.64 (dd, J=15.9, 1.2, 1 H, HC(8)); 6.15 (dd,
J=15.8, 5.8, 1 H, HC(7)); 4.66 (m, 1 H, HC(6)); 4.45 (sext, J=5.6, 1 H,
HC(2)); 2.85 (d, J=3.2, 1 H, HO); 2.78 (m, 1 H, HC(5)); 2.80-2.62 (ABX, 2
H, H2C(3)); 1.22 (d,J=6.1, 3 H, H3C(1)); 1.18 (d, J=7.3, 3 H, H3C(11));
1.08-1.03 (m, 21 H, HC(9), H3C(10)) 13C NMR: (126 MHz, CDCl3) 213.97
(C(4)); 136.61 (C(12)); 131.13 (C(7)); 128.96 (C(8)); 128.57 (C(14));
127.67 (C(15)); 126.46 (C(13)); 72.00 (C(6)); 65.12 (C(2)); 51.97 (C(3));
51.44 (C(5)); 24.06 (C(1)); 18.06 (C(10)); 12.38 (C(9)); 10.16 (C(11))
IR: (neat) 3436 (br, m); 2963 (s); 2943 (s); 2892 (m); 2867 (s); 1707
(m); 1462 (m); 1374 (m); 1130 (m); 1013 (s) MS: (FI) 404.1 (M+, 18);
385.1 (8); 361.1 (7); 321.0 (9); 273.1 (10); 272.1 (21); 245.0 (9); 230.1
(19); 229.1 (100); 156.0 (8); 133.0 (12); 132.0 (74) Opt. Rot.: [α]24D +
27.7 (c = 0.50, EtOH) TLC: Rf 0.20 (pentane/ether, 2/1) [silica gel,
short uv] SFC: tR 3.231 min (OD, 150 bar, 3 mL/min, 15% MeOH) Analysis:
C24H40O3Si (404.66) Calcd: C, 71.23; H, 9.96% Found: C, 71.29; H, 10.31%.
