$DATUM General/Typical Procedure:
(1R,2R,5S)-5-tert-Butyldimethylsilyloxy-2-methyl-1-hydroxy-1-phenyl-3-hexanone
(syn,anti-11a). Trichlorosilyl enol ether (Z)-7 (364 mg, 1.00 mmol) was
added to a solution of (R,R)-20a (37 mg, 0.10 mmol, 0.10 equiv) in 1.00
mL of CH2Cl2. The reaction mixture was cooled to -78 °C and PhCHO (102
μL, 1.00 mmol, 1 equiv) was added by syringe. After stirring for 6 h, the
reaction mixture was quenched by pouring it into a vigorously stirring
solution of cold, sat. aq. NaHCO3 solution (15 mL). The resulting slurry
was stirred for 3 h and was filtered through Celite. The layers were
separated, and the aqueous layer was extracted with 20 mL of CH2Cl2. The
organic phases were combined, washed with 5 mL of brine and were dried
(Na2SO4), filtered, and concentrated. The crude product was purified by
column chromatography (pentane/ether, 3/1, SiO2).
(2S,5S,6S)-2-Triisopropylsilyloxy-11,12-dimethyl-6-hydroxy-8-phenyl-7-octen-4-one
(syn,syn-12e). Yield: 344 mg (0.82 mmol, 82%) of 12e as a clear, viscous
oil. Data for (syn,syn)-12e: 1H NMR: (500 MHz, CDCl3) 7.33 (t, J=7.3, 2
H, HC(15)); 7.27 (d, J=6.6, 2 H, HC(14)); 7.21 (t, J=7.4, 1 H, HC(16));
6.62 (br s, 1 H, HC(8)); 4.52 (br s, 1 H, HC(6)); 4.45 (sext, J=5.9, 1 H,
HC(2)); 2.91 (d, J=2.9, 1 H, HO); 2.86 (qd, J=7.3, 3.6, 1 H, HC(5));
2.84-2.62 (ABX, 2 H, H2C(3)); 1.83 (d, J=0.7, 3 H, H3C(12)); 1.23
(d,J=6.1, 3 H, H3C(1)); 1.13 (d, J=7.3, 3 H, H3C(11)); 1.06 (m, 21 H,
HC(9), H3C(10)) 13C NMR: (126 MHz, CDCl3) 213.98 (C(4)); 137.61 (C(13));
136.44 (C(7)); 128.99 (C(15)); 128.08 (C(14)); 126.38 (C(16)); 125.92
(C(8)); 75.01 (C(6)); 65.07 (C(2)); 51.75 (C(3)); 49.03 (C(5)); 24.12
(C(1)); 18.03 (C(10)); 15.25 (C(12)); 12.36 (C(9)); 9.42 (C(11)) IR:
(neat) 3467 (br, m); 2943 (s); 2866 (s); 1705 (m); 1462 (m); 1375 (m);
1130 (m); 1097 (m); 1012 (m) MS: (FI) 418.2 (M+, 55); 401.2 (3); 375.2
(14); 337.1 (4); 272.2 (95); 229.1 (100); 201.3 (5); 146.1 (99) Opt.
Rot.: [α]24D +15.1 (c = 2.2, EtOH) TLC: Rf 0.22 (pentane/ether, 3/1)
[silica gel, short uv] SFC: tR 2.983 min (OD, 150 bar, 3 mL/min, 15%
MeOH) Analysis: C25H42O3Si (418.68) Calcd: C, 71.72; H, 10.11% Found: C,
71.46; H, 10.04%.
